---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Claudia Cervantes | Portfolio</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #0b0b0b;
        color: #f5f5f5;
      }

	  main {
  		padding: 48px 24px 80px;
	  }
	  
	  .hero {
  	    padding: 40px 0 20px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: #b3b3b3;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #d4d4d4;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 0 32px;
      }

      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .links a {
        color: #f5f5f5;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        transition: 0.2s ease;
      }

      .links a:hover {
        border-color: #f5f5f5;
      }

	  .lang {
	    font-size: 0.8em;
		opacity: 0.65;
	  }	

	  .links a {
	    font-size: 0.95rem;
	  }

	  .projects {
	    padding: 80px 0;
	  }

	  .projects h2 {
	    font-size: 2rem;
	    margin-bottom: 32px;
	  }

	  .project-grid {
	    display: grid;
	    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
	    gap: 28px;
	  }

	  .project-card {
	    text-decoration: none;
	    color: inherit;
	    border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
	    border-radius: 14px;
	    overflow: hidden;
	    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border 0.2s ease;
	  }

	  .project-card:hover {
	    transform: translateY(-4px);
	    border-color: #444;
	  }

	  .project-card img {
	    width: 100%;
	    height: 220px;
		object-fit: contain;
	    display: #111;
	  }

	  .project-card h3 {
	    font-size: 1.1rem;
	    padding: 16px 16px 4px;
	  }

	  .project-card p {
	    font-size: 0.9rem;
	    color: #bfbfbf;
	    padding: 0 16px 18px;
	  }
	
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
    	<div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p>
        <h1>Claudia Cervantes</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          Data Analyst with a background in CRM, operations, and cross-functional
          project coordination. I build clear, actionable insights through
          dashboards, reporting, and data storytelling.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/claudia-cervantes-worldwide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/cloud9international"" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          <a href="/claudia-cervantes-cv-en.pdf" target="_blank">CV <span class="lang">(English)</span></a>
  		  <a href="/claudia-cervantes-cv-es.pdf" target="_blank">CV <span class="lang">(Español)</span></a>
          <a href="mailto:claudia.cervantes.worldwide@gmail.com?subject=Portfolio Contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
		
      	</div>
	    </section>
	  <section class="projects">
		<div class="container">
		<h2>Featured Projects</h2>

		<div class="project-grid">

		<a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/cloud9international/musicstream-data-insights-pipeline" target="_blank">
			<img src="/projects/musicstream-pipeline.jpg" alt="MusicStream pipeline analysis">
			<h3>MusicStream Analytics Pipeline</h3>
			<p>End-to-end pipeline integrating Spotify and Last.fm APIs to extract and structure music data. Processed with Python and stored in MySQL for analysis.</p>
		</a>

		<a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/cloud9international/world-happiness-data-insights-dashboard" target="_blank">
			<img src="/projects/world-happiness-dashboard.jpg" alt="World Happiness dashboard">
			<h3>World Happiness Report Dashboard</h3>
			<p>Multi-source happiness dataset integrated and analyzed using Python ETL workflows and visualized in Power BI.</p>
		</a>

		<a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/cloud9international/employee-data-audit-retention-insights" target="_blank">
			<img src="/projects/employee-retention-analysis.jpg" alt="Employee retention analysis">
			<h3>Employee Retention Analytics</h3>
			<p>Employee dataset audit uncovering attrition patterns through data cleaning, transformation, and visualization.</p>
		</a>

		<a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/cloud9international/friends-data-insights-tableau-dashboard" target="_blank">
			<img src="/projects/friends-tableau-dashboard.jpg" alt="Friends Tableau dashboard">
			<h3>Friends Analytics Dashboard</h3>
			<p>Interactive Tableau dashboard analyzing episode ratings and viewership trends across the full series.</p>
		</a>

		</div>
	</div>
	</section>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>